  "note": "3rds on the G and B strings and 6ths on the G and high e strings, mixed: a 3rd then a 6th from the same G-string note, 3rds up and 6ths down, then both over the 1st, 4th and 5th chords. The key and tempo move (any key, 60 to 80 bpm): the chords are chord tokens counted the long way once, the title and headings use {{=key}} and tokens, and a {{?key}} line says what stays the same.",
